---
// ActivitiesSection.astro - Homepage activities cards
---

<section id="activities" style="scroll-margin-top:6rem;" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-maroon-50 to-burgundy-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-maroon-600 font-semibold mb-3">Explore</p>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-maroon-900 mb-4">
        Activities at CMSA
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-maroon-800 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Chinmaya Mission San Antonio offers a range of activities for all age groups, blending spiritual growth, cultural learning, and community connection.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="group rounded-2xl border border-maroon-200 bg-white shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-maroon-500 to-burgundy-500"></div>
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-maroon-100 text-maroon-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5zm0 0v7m0 0l-5-2.5M12 21l5-2.5"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-maroon-900 mb-3">Balavihar</h3>
          <p class="text-maroon-800 leading-relaxed">A joyful children’s program that blends values, heritage, and spiritual learning for ages 4 to 18.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group rounded-2xl border border-burgundy-200 bg-white shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-burgundy-500 to-maroon-500"></div>
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-burgundy-100 text-burgundy-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.75A2.25 2.25 0 1 0 12 11.25 2.25 2.25 0 0 0 12 6.75zm0 0V3m0 3c-5 0-8 2.5-8 6.75v3.75h16v-3.75C20 9.25 17 6.75 12 6.75z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-maroon-900 mb-3">Adult Study Sessions</h3>
          <p class="text-maroon-800 leading-relaxed">Explore Vedantic scriptures, practical wisdom, and spiritual discussions in a supportive learning community.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group rounded-2xl border border-maroon-200 bg-white shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-maroon-600 to-gold"></div>
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3l7 4v5c0 4.4-2.8 8.4-7 9-4.2-.6-7-4.6-7-9V7l7-4z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-maroon-900 mb-3">Yoga &amp; Meditation</h3>
          <p class="text-maroon-800 leading-relaxed">Develop inner calm, physical balance, and focused awareness through guided practice and reflection.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group rounded-2xl border border-burgundy-200 bg-white shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-burgundy-600 to-maroon-600"></div>
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 text-rose-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 5v2m-6-2v2m-3 4h12M7 15h10l-1 4H8l-1-4z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-maroon-900 mb-3">Bhajans &amp; Chanting</h3>
          <p class="text-maroon-800 leading-relaxed">Experience devotional chanting, sacred music, and uplifting group singing rooted in tradition and joy.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group rounded-2xl border border-maroon-200 bg-white shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-maroon-500 to-gold"></div>
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gold/15 text-maroon-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v8m4-4H8m8 0a4 4 0 1 1-8 0 4 4 0 0 1 8 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-maroon-900 mb-3">Pujas &amp; Festivals</h3>
          <p class="text-maroon-800 leading-relaxed">Join sacred ceremonies and festive celebrations conducted with devotion, joy, and timeless traditions.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group rounded-2xl border border-burgundy-200 bg-white shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-burgundy-500 to-maroon-500"></div>
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-maroon-100 text-burgundy-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 8h16M4 12h10m-10 4h6"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-maroon-900 mb-3">Community Service</h3>
          <p class="text-maroon-800 leading-relaxed">Participate in service initiatives that embody compassion, generosity, and social responsibility.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
